\f0\fs24 \cf0 Screen Remote Installation Guide\
\
1. Drag \'93Screen Remote.app\'94 to the Applications folder.\
2. Open Screen Remote from Applications.\
\
If macOS prevents the app from opening, use one of these methods:\
\
One-click repair\
1. Run \'93Fix Cannot Open\'94 from the disk image.\
2. Enter your macOS password when prompted.\
3. The repair tool removes the quarantine attribute and opens Screen Remote.\
\
System Settings\
1. Try to open Screen Remote once.\
2. Open System Settings (or System Preferences) \uc0\u8594  Privacy & Security.\
3. Click \'93Open Anyway\'94, then confirm that you want to open Screen Remote.\
\
Terminal\
Run the following command:\
\
xattr -cr "/Applications/Screen Remote.app"\
